OL,5,GUK Weather Forecast                    
OL,7,GTuesday:FA cloudy but dry day away     
OL,8,Ffrom the band of rain which stalls in  
OL,9,Fa line from southwest England to       
OL,10,Fwestern Scotland. Remaining chilly for 
OL,11,Fmost with a noticeable breeze.         
OL,13,GOutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FRain  
OL,14,Fand hill snow lingers over Scotland on 
OL,15,FWednesday but mostly dry and fine      
OL,16,Felsewhere. Further rain arrives in     
OL,17,FNorthern Ireland on Thursday afternoon 
OL,18,Fand pushes eastwards through Friday.   
